[s2;= Tutorial: The Boing Ball&]
[s5; Building a simple version of the iconic 1984 Amiga Boing Ball 
demo is a perfect exercise for understanding the basics of SculptorCtrl 
and modern OpenGL pipelines. In this tutorial, we will explore 
the architecture of the SculptorCtrl, break down the mathematics 
behind the procedural graphics, and assemble the C`+`+ logic 
to bring the bouncing sphere to life.&]
