odelGL][C  ]objects. The sphere is generated automatically by [^topic`:`/`/SculptorCtrl`/src`/Upp`_SculptorCtrl`_ModelGL`_en`-us`#Upp`:`:ModelGL`:`:AddSphere`(float`,int`,int`,int64`)^ A
ddSphere()] method. For the room, we manually construct two continuous 
planes, (a floor and a back wall) to hold our math`-driven grid.&]
